From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincent Yen <vincent.yen@mitaccomputing.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Software: Version: add CPLD version purposes

Add version purposes for the motherboard, switch, backplane, fan board,
and PCIe interposer board CPLDs.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [No upstream maintenance]
Signed-off-by: Vincent Yen <vincent.yen@mitaccomputing.com>
---
 .../Software/Version.interface.yaml           | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Software/Version.interface.yaml b/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Software/Version.interface.yaml
index 2bb8aab..43e7a2d 100644
--- a/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Software/Version.interface.yaml
+++ b/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Software/Version.interface.yaml
@@ -42,6 +42,21 @@ enumerations:
           - name: PSU
             description: >
                 The version is a version for a PSU.
+          - name: MB_CPLD
+            description: >
+                The version is a version for a motherboard CPLD.
+          - name: SW_CPLD
+            description: >
+                The version is a version for a switch CPLD.
+          - name: BP_CPLD
+            description: >
+                The version is a version for a backplane board CPLD.
+          - name: FB_CPLD
+            description: >
+                The version is a version for a fan board CPLD.
+          - name: PCIB_CPLD
+            description: >
+                The version is a version for a PCIe interposer board CPLD.
 
 associations:
     - name: running
-- 
2.43.0
